{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>警方今日（22日）下午1時42分接報指，深水埗西九龍中心有一名女長者在扶手梯跌倒，並陷入昏迷。消防及救護員接報到場，將事主送院治理，事主其後回復清醒。警員正調查事件經過及原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T08:23:45.889848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T07:34:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T02:42:15.093126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:23.337420+00:00","content_hash":"fdcf9b42a60850176362200aa3b369e8625c2b3ea72af18e3262d8006a9b5bb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}